# Real threat-actor / victim data + trained models — KEEP LOCAL, never track.
# NOTE: .gitignore does NOT delete these files; it keeps them on disk but out of git,
# so the sensitive corpus/labels/models/notes never reach git history or GitHub.
# Blocklist of every data-carrying extension in this dir (code is .py/.sh/.html).
*.jsonl
*.md
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.log
*.err
*.out
*.csv
*.db
mmbert-incident/
mmbert-incident-ml/
__pycache__/
# To intentionally track a doc here despite the *.md rule: git add -f dataset/FOO.md
